    "ParentObjectID": "advanced_copper_tools_copper_rim_chamberpot",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_CopperRimChamberpot_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Use:</b> Urinate or defecate in it when you need to, with a small mood bump for not having to go outside. Fills up after 4 uses.\n\n<b>Empty:</b> Empty it out to use it again. If you defecated in it, the waste makes a pile of manure for the compost bin or fields."
  },
